  "prompt": "What is the average number of units per order on each weekday? An order's units are the quantity summed over its lines. order_ts holds the order time in UTC; use the weekday of the UTC day. Orders with no lines do not count. Return two columns, in this order: weekday_name, the weekday's English name such as Monday, and avg_units. Return one row for each weekday that has orders. Do not round. Any row order is fine.",
